# Weekly blog build (Mejor Vida)

When creating or editing **weekly insurance update** posts or the blog index:

1. Follow **`tools/blog-build-rules.md`** end-to-end — especially **§1 Bilingual parity** (paired `data-lang` paragraphs, **two** `<details>` blocks per long briefing with `data-lang="en"` and `data-lang="es"`, full FAQ/conclusion/sidebar in Spanish matching English depth).

2. Never ship Spanish as a short summary when English is long-form in the same section.

3. After a new post file: update **`blog.html`** (summary block + new card first in `#blog-feed`) and **`sitemap.xml`** (new URL + `blog.html` lastmod).

Reference post: `blog/weekly-insurance-update-2026-04-12.html`.
